The Twin Towers of the World Trade Center, The Pentagon, and The U.S Capitol have been hit by hijacked american commercial airplanes.

Several american organizations like the FBI and the CIA have work together to identify the attackers, the attackers were a part of a terrorist group called "Al-Qaeda" led by Osama bin Laden.

The O5 Council they have also identified that the Chaos Insurgents are also involved in this attack but their motives unknown.

- @mourn: May those who passed away because of this tragic event rest in peace.

